WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.900
The prerequisite medium bomb is planted beside the knocked-down Ryu; two cans remain.

2
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.050
Kimberly catches the waking Ryu with the normal throw.

3
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:02.900
The existing bomb detonates during the throw follow-through and launches Ryu.

4
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.250
The OD air grab catches the bomb launch.

5
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:06.000
Sprint launcher picks up the OD rebound.

6
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:06.600
The red-punch heavy plant spends one further spray can.

7
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:07.250
Ryu rises beside the newly planted heavy bomb.
